her live player: you keep playing solo, with a field, and you're pulled into the mat","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-12T17:31:30Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067941831","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:02:36Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4762500-1845383656394903","game_id":"steam-4762500","kind":"announcement","title":"The Arena is always open","summary":"Until today, racing in the Arena meant catching another player online at the same moment. Now you can queue any time. If nobody else is queued, the open seats fill with recorded runs from real players, clearly labelled as replays, on the same deal you're playing. Live players are always seated first, and you can choose to wait for a live opponent instead. Also in 1.4.39: a \"How to play\" card for anyone new to FreeCell, and arrows on the Daily Challenge win screen to step back through past days. ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-05T23:57:58Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656394903","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:02:36Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4762500-1844751498225333","game_id":"steam-4762500","kind":"announcement","title":"Race the dev live, every night of Next Fest","summary":"Every night of Steam Next Fest, from 7 to 8 PM PT / 10 to 11 PM ET, the developer is in the Arena. Grab the free demo, queue up, and race the dev on the identical deal. How it works Everyone gets the same shuffle. Whoever solves it first wins, and every race is timed to the millisecond. What's in the free demo Arena Queue: live races against other players on the same deal The worldwide Daily Challenge Unlimited casual deals at every difficulty How to join Launch the demo and open the Arena Queue","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-25T17:01:46Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498225333","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:02:36Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4762500-1844115010493300","game_id":"steam-4762500","kind":"announcement","title":"Hardcore Weekend - one life, in the free demo","summary":"Hardcore opens in the free demo for one weekend.From Friday morning, September 25 through Sunday night, September 27 - Arizona time, UTC-7, and we don't do daylight saving - Hardcore mode is unlocked in the free demo of MSO FreeCell Arena, and in the free iPhone and Android apps at the same time. It has never been open there before.What Hardcore isNo undo. No hints. No restart. One life.A solver runs in the background while you play, and it isn't there to help you. It's the referee. The moment y","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-17T21:13:04Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010493300","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:02:36Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4762500-1843481262690546","game_id":"steam-4762500","kind":"announcement","title":"Arena Hour — race the dev live, every night","summary":"Every night, 7-8 PM Arizona time, the arena lights up for one hour.Arena Queue matches you against whoever else is racing. Everyone draws the same deal at the same moment, and the leaderboard moves while you play. First to win, lowest moves, best time - all tracked, all visible.The developer is in the queue. Beat him in a live race and you earn one of the rarest badges in the game, plus the Steam achievement. He plays every night. Good luck.How to be there:The free Demo is enough. The Arena Queu","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-09T22:42:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262690546","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:02:36Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4762500":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:07:16Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:07:15Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4762500":"2026-10-26T14:07:16Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4762500":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:07:15Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T14:07:15Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:07:15Z"},"4762520":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T14:07:16Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T14:07:16Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T14:07:16Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4762500","app_id":4762500,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:55Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"b8ae8fb6bb60299310b679c2989b85776c984e982710ea8730666485480fe11c","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"Real-time multiplayer FreeCell. Same deal, real rivals: everyone gets the same shuffle and races to solve it, every race timed to the millisecond. Race the nightly Arena Hour, take the worldwide Daily Challenge, and try to beat the dev. Free to download and play. No microtransactions.","publishers":[{"name":"MSO Games"}],"developers":[{"name":"MSO Games"}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":1798704000,"is_coming_soon":true,"coming_soon_display":"date_quarter"},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"Trailer 2.1 (Next Fest)","trailer_url_format":"steam/apps/${FILENAME}?t=1790212379","trailer_category":1,"microtrailer":[{"filename":"4762